u2.jar is bundled unmodified from https://github.com/openatx/android-uiautomator-server-jar, release 0.4.1
(sha256 87c8ac9505970d42aa5922baa90114808fda6f47f9e5fbd4caa0f621c2c8d30d), the jar the uiautomator2 Python
package itself pins. BotMaker pushes it to an Android device's /data/local/tmp to read the screen's
accessibility tree; it installs no app.

It contains JUnit, under the Eclipse Public License 1.0; its licence text is LICENSE-junit.txt inside the jar.
Its other parts are under the licence below.

